00:14:48.480 --> 00:14:49.100
I don't know.
我不知道。

321
00:14:49.260 --> 00:14:50.160
Wait, did Charlie win?
等等，查理获奖了吗？

322
00:14:50.300 --> 00:14:51.360
Charlie didn't win either.
查理也没获奖。

323
00:14:51.360 --> 00:14:52.420
Well, son of a...
好吧，真他妈的……

324
00:14:52.420 --> 00:14:53.020
I know.
我知道。

325
00:14:53.420 --> 00:14:54.480
You know, it's crazy.
你知道的，这太疯狂了。

326
00:14:54.620 --> 00:14:58.020
That got me thinking about how you have to submit yourself for awards.
这让我想起你必须自己去申报奖项这件事。

327
00:14:58.020 --> 00:15:00.260
I feel like that's something not a lot of people know.
我觉得很多人并不知道这一点。

328
00:15:00.640 --> 00:15:01.640
We did.
我们做过。

329
00:15:01.960 --> 00:15:03.400
