But I think as an actor, you pick one or two episodes that you think best represent your
但我觉得作为演员，你会挑选一两集你认为最能代表你

334
00:15:14.360 --> 00:15:14.920
performance.
演技的剧集。

335
00:15:15.440 --> 00:15:17.960
You also pick your category.
你还要选择你的组别。

336
00:15:17.960 --> 00:15:22.140
You can decide if you want to be submitted for lead or supporting.
你可以决定你是想报主角还是配角。

337
00:15:22.480 --> 00:15:22.940
I know.
我知道。

338
00:15:23.080 --> 00:15:28.440
I was very excited because season four of The Office, there was an article that said I was
我当时非常兴奋，因为在《办公室》第四季时，有一篇文章说我是

339
00:15:28.440 --> 00:15:34.560
a dark horse for a nomination for supporting actress in a comedy because I had that whole
喜剧类剧集最佳女配角提名的黑马，因为我有整条

340
00:15:34.560 --> 00:15:37.560
great arc with sprinkles and all of that.
关于斯普林克尔等一系列精彩的故事线。

341
00:15:37.660 --> 00:15:38.020
Yes.
是的。

342
00:15:38.220 --> 00:15:39.540
And I was so excited.
我当时超级兴奋。

343
00:15:39.900 --> 00:15:41.240
That was enough for me.
对我就这就足够了。

344
00:15:41.780 --> 00:15:47.540
I mean, I realized that some people were able to have sort of a big machine behind them campaigning,
我的意思是，我意识到有些人能够依靠强大的幕后团队为他们进行宣传，

