I can't say donut and not provide you with a donut.
我一说出甜甜圈，就不能不给你提供一个。

362
00:16:21.420 --> 00:16:23.700
You literally said it's time to make the donuts.
你刚才明明说该做甜甜圈了。

363
00:16:24.000 --> 00:16:24.900
Oh, no.
噢，不是。

