This is not a Scotch and Splenda.
这不是苏格兰威士忌加蔗糖素。

365
00:16:27.260 --> 00:16:27.680
I know.
我知道。

366
00:16:28.000 --> 00:16:30.360
You got me thinking it's a Scotch and Splenda moment.
你让我以为现在是喝苏格兰威士忌加蔗糖素的时候。

367
00:16:31.020 --> 00:16:36.940
No, this is a little mini deep dive that I found incredibly charming based on the fact
不，这是一个我发现极其迷人的小深度剖析，

368
00:16:36.940 --> 00:16:39.880
that Michael says it's time to make the donuts.
因为迈克尔说该做甜甜圈了。

369
00:16:40.220 --> 00:16:41.380
Oh, the expression.
噢，这个表达。

370
00:16:41.720 --> 00:16:42.240
Yes.
对。

371
00:16:42.620 --> 00:16:44.440
Do you remember that commercial?
你还记得那个广告吗？

372
00:16:44.440 --> 00:16:46.500
It was from the 80s.
那是80年代的。

373
00:16:46.600 --> 00:16:52.440
It actually ran from 1981 all the way to 1997, and it was for Dunkin' Donuts.
它其实从1981年一直播到1997年，是为唐恩都乐拍的。

374
00:16:52.660 --> 00:16:54.060
Do you remember it?
你还记得吗？

375
00:16:54.360 --> 00:16:56.320
Well, I was overseas until 84.
嗯，我84年之前都在海外。

376
00:16:56.920 --> 00:16:57.320
Okay.
好吧。

377
00:16:57.840 --> 00:17:01.060
This, by the way, is a thing my husband loves to tease me about.
顺便说一句，我丈夫经常拿这个调侃我。

