00:17:06.660 --> 00:17:09.280
But there's some pop culture that's lost on you.
但有些流行文化你确实错过了。

380
00:17:09.400 --> 00:17:09.760
Yes.
对。

381
00:17:10.240 --> 00:17:10.640
Okay.
好吧。

382
00:17:10.640 --> 00:17:12.480
Well, I grew up without television.
我是在没有电视的环境中长大的。

383
00:17:12.640 --> 00:17:13.240
Isn't that crazy?
是不是很疯狂？

384
00:17:13.560 --> 00:17:14.820
Until I was a teenager.
直到我十几岁的时候。

385
00:17:15.440 --> 00:17:15.840
Wow.
哇。

386
00:17:16.180 --> 00:17:16.540
I know.
就是说啊。

387
00:17:17.020 --> 00:17:18.740
And then you wound up on television.
然后你最后居然上了电视。

388
00:17:19.020 --> 00:17:21.000
And then I was obsessed with television.
然后我就对电视着了迷。

389
00:17:21.200 --> 00:17:21.820
I bet.
我敢说肯定是这样。

390
00:17:22.380 --> 00:17:26.000
It's like the kid that, like, their parents don't let them have any sweets, and then they
就像那种父母不让他们吃任何糖果的小孩，

391
00:17:26.000 --> 00:17:27.660
come to your house and they raid your pantry.
然后他们来到你家，把你的零食柜洗劫一空。

392
00:17:28.020 --> 00:17:28.340
Yeah.
是啊。

393
00:17:28.480 --> 00:17:30.620
I became, like, obsessed with television.
我变得简直对电视着了迷。

394
00:17:30.880 --> 00:17:32.300
Well, let me bring you up to speed.
好吧，让我来给你补补课。

395
00:17:32.440 --> 00:17:32.640
Okay.
好。

396
00:17:32.640 --> 00:17:40.460
Fred the Baker was a character played by actor Michael Vail in these Dunkin' Donut commercials.
“面包师弗雷德”是演员迈克尔·维尔在这些唐恩都乐广告中扮演的角色。

397
00:17:40.800 --> 00:17:41.040
Okay.
好。

398
00:17:41.300 --> 00:17:44.380
And he was known for his catchphrase, time to make the donuts.
他以自己的口头禅“该做甜甜圈了”而闻名。

399
00:17:44.980 --> 00:17:51.560
So it would just be him, like, all day coming in and out of his door saying, time to make
所以剧情就是他一整天都在进进出出他的门，

400
00:17:51.560 --> 00:17:52.020
the donuts.
嘴里念叨着“该做甜甜圈了”。

