00:17:52.300 --> 00:17:54.080
I actually have an audio clip of it.
其实我这里有一段相关的音频。

402
00:17:54.120 --> 00:17:55.120
Oh, I need to hear it.
哦，我得听听。

403
00:17:56.000 --> 00:17:57.500
Time to make the donuts.
该做甜甜圈了。

404
00:17:57.840 --> 00:17:59.720
Dunkin' Donuts are always fresh.
唐恩都乐的甜甜圈总是新鲜出炉。

405
00:18:00.420 --> 00:18:01.860
I made the donuts.
我做好了甜甜圈。

406
00:18:01.860 --> 00:18:03.860
We make them at least twice every day.
我们每天至少做两次。

407
00:18:04.060 --> 00:18:05.000
Time to make the donuts.
该做甜甜圈了。

408
00:18:05.920 --> 00:18:08.240
Not a few kinds, like supermarkets.
不是超市那种只有区区几种。

409
00:18:08.660 --> 00:18:09.480
Hey, the donuts.
嘿，甜甜圈。

410
00:18:10.040 --> 00:18:11.240
Time to make the donuts.
该做甜甜圈了。

411
00:18:11.340 --> 00:18:12.780
But up to 52 varieties.
而是多达52种口味。

412
00:18:13.220 --> 00:18:13.720
The donuts.
那些甜甜圈。

413
00:18:15.160 --> 00:18:18.340
Time to make the donuts.
该做甜甜圈了。

414
00:18:18.840 --> 00:18:20.180
I made the donuts.
我做好了甜甜圈。

415
00:18:20.320 --> 00:18:23.320
Dunkin' Donuts, up to 52 varieties, fresh day and night.
唐恩都乐，多达52种口味，日夜新鲜。

416
00:18:23.500 --> 00:18:24.940
No supermarket can say that.
没有任何一家超市敢这么说。

417
00:18:25.120 --> 00:18:27.500
So Fred the Baker had to make all those donuts, lady.
所以面包师弗雷德必须做完所有这些甜甜圈，女士。

418
00:18:27.640 --> 00:18:30.160
I have so many questions, because I could only hear it and not see it.
我有一肚子的问题，因为我刚才只能听到声音，却看不到画面。

419
00:18:30.220 --> 00:18:31.700
It sounds like he's getting really tired.
听起来他好像真的很累。

420
00:18:31.960 --> 00:18:32.820
He's tired?
他很累吗？

421
00:18:32.820 --> 00:18:34.880
He's making donuts in the rain.
他在雨中做甜甜圈。

422
00:18:35.100 --> 00:18:36.600
Time to make the donuts.
该做甜甜圈了。

423
00:18:36.840 --> 00:18:38.320
Because he's always making the donuts.
因为他总是在做甜甜圈。

424
00:18:39.440 --> 00:18:45.100
Well, this commercial was named one of the five best commercials of the 80s by the Television
这个广告被电视广告局评为

