Variable and fixed costs are the two main types of costs that a company incurs.
变动成本和固定成本是公司产生的两类主要成本。

1011
00:44:12.790 --> 00:44:13.010
Okay.
好的。

1012
00:44:13.510 --> 00:44:16.330
Variable costs are volume related.
变动成本与业务量相关。

1013
00:44:16.690 --> 00:44:17.030
Okay.
好的。

1014
00:44:17.210 --> 00:44:20.710
